had been trying to get the " [:a {:href "/organizations/1"} "IOC"] " to add a women’s foil team event but was unsuccessful. The FIE did not hold its European Championships in the Olympic years but, in 1932, it held a women’s foil team European Championship, and continued to hold women’s foil team championships in the Olympic years until 1960, when a " [:a {:href "/results/90185"} "team foil event for women"] " was added to the Olympic programme."] "\n\n" [:p {} "Of the 21 available medals, 16 went to Italy, France, and Hungary, with all three nations winning two men’s events. Italy won eight medals in all – two gold, four silver, and two bronze –, while France and Hungary both won four total medals."] "\n\n" [:p {} "As in " [:a {:href "/editions/9/sports/FEN"} "1928"] ", there was some question within the IOC about continuing to allow women to fence. However, the IOC voted 17-2 in favor of keeping women’s foil on the Olympic Programme. In 1936, the vote would be unanimous, and women have competed in fencing continuously since 1924."] "\n\n"] "\n\n" [:h2 {} "Events"] "\n" [:table {:class "table table-striped"} "\n" [:thead {} "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:th {} "Event"] "\n" [:th {} "Status"] "\n" [:th {} "Date"] "\n" [:th {} "Participants"] "\n" [:th {} "NOCs"] "\n"] "\n"] "\n" [:tbody {} [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/80451"} "Foil, Individual, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "2 –  4 August 1932"] "\n" [:td {} "26"] "\n" [:td {} "12"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/81179"} "Foil, Team, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "31 July –  1 August 1932"] "\n" [:td {} "30"] "\n" [:td {} "6"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/80677"} "Épée, Individual, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "8 –  9 August 1932"] "\n" [:td {} "28"] "\n" [:td {} "12"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/81406"} "Épée, Team, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "5 –  7 August 1932"] "\n" [:td {} "34"] "